<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>LightRFP ESBD Report</title>
    <style>
        :root { --bg:#f4f1ea; --panel:#fffdf8; --panel-soft:#fbf8f1; --ink:#1d2a31; --muted:#5d6a71; --accent:#0f6a73; --accent-soft:#d8ecee; --line:#d9d0c3; --good:#305f3b; }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { margin:0; font-family:Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; color:var(--ink); background:radial-gradient(circle at top right, #efe2c6 0, transparent 30%), linear-gradient(180deg, #f6f1e7 0%, #f1ede5 100%); }
        .page { max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:32px 20px 48px; }
        .hero, .section, .card { background:var(--panel); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:18px; box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(44, 56, 67, 0.06); }
        .hero { padding:28px; margin-bottom:24px; }
        h1, h2, h3 { margin:0; line-height:1.1; }
        h1 { font-size:clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.3rem); letter-spacing:0.02em; }
        h2 { font-size:1.45rem; }
        h3 { font-size:0.95rem; letter-spacing:0.04em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--muted); }
        .subtitle { margin-top:12px; color:var(--muted); font-size:1.05rem; max-width:60rem; }
        .stats { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr)); gap:14px; margin-top:24px; }
        .stat { padding:16px; background:var(--panel-soft); border-radius:14px; border:1px solid var(--line); }
        .stat-label { color:var(--muted); font-size:0.85rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.08em; }
        .stat-value { display:block; margin-top:6px; font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:bold; }
        .results { display:grid; gap:18px; }
        .card { padding:24px; }
        .card-head { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; gap:18px; margin-bottom:18px; }
        .title-row { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:14px; }
        .rank-badge { min-width:52px; height:52px; border-radius:16px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-weight:bold; font-size:1.1rem; color:var(--accent); background:#edf5f6; border:1px solid #c9dfe1; flex-shrink:0; }
        .card-title a { color:var(--ink); text-decoration:none; }
        .card-title a:hover { color:var(--accent); }
        .card-subtitle { margin-top:10px; color:var(--muted); font-size:0.98rem; line-height:1.5; }
        .badges { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; justify-content:flex-end; }
        .badge { padding:7px 11px; border-radius:999px; font-size:0.86rem; font-weight:bold; background:var(--accent-soft); color:var(--accent); }
        .badge.score { background:#e5f2e7; color:var(--good); }
        .card-body { display:grid; gap:18px; }
        .info-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr; gap:18px; }
        .panel { background:var(--panel-soft); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:16px; padding:18px; }
        .panel + .panel { margin-top:0; }
        .detail-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap:14px 18px; margin-top:14px; }
        .detail-item strong { display:block; font-size:0.78rem; color:var(--muted); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:6px; }
        .detail-item span, .detail-item div { line-height:1.5; overflow-wrap:anywhere; word-break:break-word; }
        .classification { overflow-wrap:anywhere; word-break:break-word; }
        a { overflow-wrap:anywhere; word-break:break-word; }
        .section-title { margin-bottom:12px; }
        .description { font-size:1rem; line-height:1.7; margin:0; }
        .classification { font-size:0.97rem; line-height:1.65; color:var(--ink); margin:0; }
        .links { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; margin-top:14px; }
        .link-chip { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; padding:9px 12px; border-radius:999px; border:1px solid #c9dfe1; background:#edf5f6; color:var(--accent); text-decoration:none; font-weight:bold; font-size:0.9rem; }
        .link-chip:hover { background:#e6f1f2; }
        .list { margin:10px 0 0; padding-left:18px; }
        .list li { margin-bottom:8px; line-height:1.55; }
        .section { padding:24px; margin-top:28px; }
        .section p, .section li { color:var(--muted); line-height:1.6; }
        .attachments a { color:var(--accent); }
        @media (max-width:880px) { .info-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
        @media (max-width:700px) { .card-head { flex-direction:column; } .badges { justify-content:flex-start; } .card { padding:20px; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <section class="hero">
            <h1>LightRFP ESBD Opportunity Report</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">
                Ranked government solicitation matches from the Texas Electronic State Business Daily.
                Generated at {{ generated_at }} from live data at <a href="{{ source_url }}">{{ source_url }}</a>.
            </p>
            <div class="stats">
                <div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">Source</span><span class="stat-value">ESBD</span></div>
                <div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">Candidates Analyzed</span><span class="stat-value">{{ total_candidates }}</span></div>
                <div class="stat"><span class="stat-label">Results Shown</span><span class="stat-value">{{ results|length }} / {{ top_n }}</span></div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <div class="results">
            {% for item in results %}
            <article class="card">
                <div class="card-head">
                    <div class="title-row">
                        <div class="rank-badge">#{{ loop.index }}</div>
                        <div class="card-title">
                            <h2><a href="{{ item.detail_url }}">{{ item.title }}</a></h2>
                            <p class="card-subtitle">{{ item.brief_description or "No description available." }}</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="badges">
                        <span class="badge score">Score {{ "%.2f"|format(item.relevance_score) }}</span>
                        {% for category in item.matched_categories %}
                        <span class="badge">{{ category }}</span>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="info-grid">
                        <section class="panel">
                            <h3 class="section-title">Solicitation Overview</h3>
                            <div class="detail-grid">
                                <div class="detail-item">
                                    <strong>Solicitation ID</strong>
                                    <span>{{ item.solicitation_id }}</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="detail-item">
                                    <strong>Agency</strong>
                                    <span>{{ item.agency_name or item.agency_number }}</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="detail-item">
                                    <strong>Status</strong>
                                    <span>{{ item.status }}</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="detail-item">
                                    <strong>Posted</strong>
                                    <span>{{ item.posting_date }}</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="detail-item">
                                    <strong>Due Date</strong>
                                    <span>{{ item.due_date or "Not listed" }}</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="detail-item">
                                    <strong>Due Time</strong>
                                    <span>{{ item.due_time or "Not listed" }}</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="links">
                                <a class="link-chip" href="{{ item.detail_url }}">Open ESBD Listing</a>
                            </div>
                        </section>
                        <section class="panel">
                            <h3 class="section-title">Contact Information</h3>
                            <div class="detail-grid">
                                <div class="detail-item">
                                    <strong>Contact</strong>
                                    <span>{{ item.contact_name or "Not listed" }}</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="detail-item">
                                    <strong>Email</strong>
                                    <span>{{ item.contact_email or item.bid_response_email or "Not listed" }}</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="detail-item">
                                    <strong>Phone</strong>
                                    <span>{{ item.contact_phone or "Not listed" }}</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </section>
                    </div>
                    <section class="panel">
                        <h3 class="section-title">Classification</h3>
                        <p class="classification">{{ item.category_classification or "Not listed" }}</p>
                    </section>
                    {% if item.ai_summary %}
                    <section class="panel">
                        <h3 class="section-title">AI Summary</h3>
                        <p class="classification">{{ item.ai_summary }}</p>
                    </section>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if item.attachment_urls %}
                    <section class="panel attachments">
                        <h3 class="section-title">Attachments</h3>
                        {% if item.pdf_extraction_summary %}
                        <p class="classification">{{ item.pdf_extraction_summary }}</p>
                        {% endif %}
                        <ul class="list">
                            {% for attachment in item.attachment_urls %}
                            <li>
                                <a href="{{ attachment.url }}">{{ attachment.name }}</a>
                                {% if attachment.description %} - {{ attachment.description }}{% endif %}
                                {% if attachment.is_pdf and attachment.pdf_extraction_status %}
                                <div><strong>PDF Extraction:</strong> {{ attachment.pdf_extraction_status }}{% if attachment.pdf_page_count %} | {{ attachment.pdf_page_count }} page(s){% endif %}</div>
                                {% endif %}
                            </li>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </ul>
                    </section>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
            </article>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <section class="section">
            <h2>Methodology</h2>
            <p>This report uses the live paginated ESBD backend service to collect the full current open-solicitation result set, scores that full listing set, and then looks up a generous shortlist through the ESBD details service to extract required fields such as title, solicitation ID, contact information, posting date, due date, classification, and attachment links.</p>
            <p>Relevance is determined by weighted keyword and fuzzy matching against the vendor service categories from the take-home brief. Matches in solicitation titles and classification codes count more heavily than weaker description-only signals, while clearly unrelated terms such as software-only or legal-service signals are penalized.</p>
            <p>This implementation favors a straightforward HTTP-first scraper because the required ESBD data is available through the public site and its live JSON services without browser automation. For a smaller high-confidence subset of candidates, the scraper also downloads PDF attachments, classifies them as text-based or likely scanned based on extractable text, and folds extracted PDF text back into ranking. If a Gemini API key is supplied, the final results can also include AI-generated summaries based on that PDF text.</p>
        </section>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
